#Spawn condition
SpawnMonarch: Use an {0} during the day.
SpawnFungus: Use a {0} in a Glowing Mushroom biome.
SpawnGrips: Use a {0} or an {1} at night.
SpawnBroodmother: Use a {0} in the Inferno during the day.
SpawnHydra: Use a {0} in the Mire at night.
SpawnSubzero: Use a {0} in the Tundra at night.
SpawnDjinn: Use a {0} in the Desert during the day.
SpawnSag: Use a {0} in the Void.
SpawnToad: Use a {0} in a glowing Mushroom biome.
SpawnAnubis: Use a {0} in the Desert.
SpawnGreed: Use a {0} at the Altar of Desire in the Hoard, or open 3 Greed Chests in the Hoard.
SpawnAthena: Use a {0} at the owl altar in the Acropolis, or wound a Seraph in the Acropolis.
SpawnRajah: Use a {0} or kill 100 Rabbits like a jerk.
SpawnAnubisA: Challenge the Legendscribe after having slain the Moon Lord.
SpawnAthenaA: Challenge Athena after having proven yourself to Anubis.
SpawnGreedA: Challenge Greed after having proven yourself to Anubis.
SpawnEquinox: Use an {0}.
SpawnAH: Use the {0}.
SpawnAkuma: Use the {0} in the Inferno during the day.
SpawnYamata: Use the {0} in the Mire at night.
SpawnZero: Use the {0} in the Void.
SpawnRajahR: Use the {0} or kill 100 rabbits after having killed at least 1000.
SpawnShen: Use the {0}.
#Despawn Messages
DespawnMonarch: The Mushroom Monarch escapes into the sky
DespawnFungus: The Feudal Fungus vanishes
DespawnGrips: The Grips fly away, having dealt with you
DespawnBroodmother: The Broodmother returns to the fiery depths
DespawnHydra: The Hydra slinks back into her dark lair
DespawnSubzero: The Subzero Serpent burrows back down into the snow
DespawnDjinn: The Desert Djinn flexes upon you triumphantly
DespawnSag: Sagittarius gallops off into the endless darkness...
DespawnToad: The Truffle Toad croaks, then vanishes
